+| --- | ---: |
+| Nodes | ${graph.compile_summary.node_count} |
+| Edges | ${graph.compile_summary.edge_count} |
+| Postures | ${graph.compile_summary.posture_count} |
+| Sources | ${graph.compile_summary.source_count} |
+| Future real 9709 question rows | ${graph.compile_summary.expected_future_counts.real_9709_question_rows} |
+| Future visual-required rows | ${graph.compile_summary.expected_future_counts.visual_required_rows} |
+| Current student-display eligible visual rows | ${graph.compile_summary.expected_future_counts.student_display_eligible_visual_rows} |
+
+Full source coverage claimed: ${graph.compile_summary.full_source_coverage_claimed}
+
+This is a deterministic skeleton compiler artifact only. Later KG-HVY issues populate the Question, Paper, SourceDocument, SourceFigureAsset, SourceVisualReceipt, MethodMap, ProcedureModel, RightsDisplayPolicy, ReviewTask, Attempt, and DiagnosisEvent graph rows.
+
+## Canonical Sources Referenced
+
+| Source | Family | Rows | Path |
+| --- | --- | ---: | --- |
+${sourceRows}
+
+## Validator Checks
+
+| Check | Status |
+| --- | --- |
+${checkRows}
+
+## Non-Goals Preserved
+
+- No source-family import implementation.
+- No production or local Supabase mutation.
+- No remote calls.
+- No runtime or frontend behavior change.
+`;
+}
